    <bpmn:process id="W_W3369" name="W3369. Public Affairs Strategy &amp; Issue Management (Non-Crisis)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Emerging public issue; complements VS-14.3 crisis comms
Frequency: Continuous + per issue
Volume: Active public-affairs issues
Owner: Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Govt Affairs Mgr, Comms/PR (links to VS-14.3), Legal (links to VS-100), affected business units, Leadership
Source: workflow W3369 — Public Affairs Strategy &amp; Issue Management (Non-Crisis)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3369_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3369_Lane1" name="Govt Affairs Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3369_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3369_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3369_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3369_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3369_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3369_Start3" name="Emerging public issue; complements VS-14.3 crisis comms">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3369_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3369_Task4" name="Govt Affairs Mgr/Comms identify and track emerging public issues affecting…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs Mgr/Comms identify and track emerging public issues affecting BuildRight&#x27;s license to operate (consumer/retail, labor, environmental, tax, supply chain, data); assess materiality and stakeholder sentiment
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr / Comms
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3369_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3369_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3369_Task5" name="Govt Affairs Mgr/Comms manage the issue: position, messaging, stakeholder…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govt Affairs Mgr/Comms manage the issue: position, messaging, stakeholder engagement (government W3356, industry W3358, community W3371, media W3373), and escalation to crisis comms when warranted (links to VS-14.3 W134/W1562)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr / Comms
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per issue</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3369_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3369_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3369_Task6" name="Govt Affairs Mgr capture outcomes and lessons, update issue playbook, and feed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govt Affairs Mgr capture outcomes and lessons, update issue playbook, and feed insights to risk register (links to VS-21.2) and reputation monitoring (W3370)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per issue</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3369_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3369_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3369_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3369_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3369_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-543 (ensure controlled execution — Public Affairs, Community Relations &amp; Reputation (PA-104.3).) | - operational: early identification and engagement; operational: coordinated messaging
Owner: Government Affairs Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
