    <bpmn:process id="W_W3371" name="W3371. Community Relations &amp; Local Stakeholder Engagement (National Brand Level)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Community program; local stakeholder need; complements VS-76.3/W2673 (barangay)
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: National brand-level community relations
Owner: Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Govt Affairs Mgr, CSR (links to VS-14.3 W135), Store Ops (links to VS-07), ESG (links to VS-25.2), Comms (links to VS-14.3)
Source: workflow W3371 — Community Relations &amp; Local Stakeholder Engagement (National Brand Level)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3371_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3371_Lane1" name="Govt Affairs Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3371_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3371_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3371_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3371_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3371_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3371_Start3" name="Community program; local stakeholder need; complements VS-76.3/W2673 (barangay)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3371_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3371_Task4" name="Govt Affairs Mgr/CSR develop the national community-relations strategy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs Mgr/CSR develop the national community-relations strategy: programs (disaster response links to VS-69, community build/repair, livelihood/cooperative links to VS-94, education/skills), alignment to BuildRight&#x27;s footprint and brand
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr / CSR
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3371_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3371_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3371_Task5" name="Govt Affairs Mgr/Store Ops engage community stakeholders at the national brand…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govt Affairs Mgr/Store Ops engage community stakeholders at the national brand level (local-government leagues, civic groups, NGOs, community leaders), coordinate with store-level LGU relations (links to VS-76.3 W2673/W2686) and disaster response (links to VS-69.3)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr / Store Ops
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3371_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3371_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3371_Task6" name="Govt Affairs Mgr/CSR measure community impact and sentiment, integrate with CSR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govt Affairs Mgr/CSR measure community impact and sentiment, integrate with CSR reporting (links to VS-14.3 W135/W151) and ESG (links to VS-25.2), and report to leadership
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr / CSR
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3371_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3371_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3371_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3371_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
