        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-543 (ensure controlled execution — Public Affairs, Community Relations &amp; Reputation (PA-104.3).) | - operational: alignment with VS-76; operational: CSR/ESG measurement
Owner: Government Affairs Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
