    <bpmn:process id="W_W3372" name="W3372. Think-Tank, Academic &amp; Policy-Institution Partnership" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Partnership opportunity; research need
Frequency: Periodic
Volume: Active partnerships
Owner: Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Govt Affairs Mgr, Strategy (links to VS-33), affected SMEs, Innovation (links to VS-30), Legal (links to VS-100)
Source: workflow W3372 — Think-Tank, Academic &amp; Policy-Institution Partnership</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3372_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3372_Lane1" name="Govt Affairs Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3372_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3372_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3372_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3372_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3372_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3372_Start3" name="Partnership opportunity; research need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3372_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3372_Task4" name="Govt Affairs Mgr/Strategy identify and engage think-tanks, academic…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs Mgr/Strategy identify and engage think-tanks, academic institutions, and policy-research bodies on retail/supply-chain/labor/sustainability policy; sponsor or commission research aligned to BuildRight&#x27;s interests
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr / Strategy
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3372_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3372_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3372_Task5" name="Govt Affairs Mgr/SMEs contribute BuildRight data/expertise to research…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govt Affairs Mgr/SMEs contribute BuildRight data/expertise to research, participate in forums/roundtables, and use the evidence base to support advocacy (W3355) and thought leadership (links to VS-33.3)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr / SMEs
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3372_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3372_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3372_Task6" name="Govt Affairs Mgr track partnership value and influence on policy debate, manage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govt Affairs Mgr track partnership value and influence on policy debate, manage conflicts/independence (links to VS-86.3), and report outcomes (W3368)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
