      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual risk cycle; complements VS-21.2 ERM
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Political/regulatory risk register
Owner: Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Govt Affairs Mgr, Risk (links to VS-21.2), Legal (links to VS-100), Strategy (links to VS-33), affected SMEs
Source: workflow W3374 — Corporate Political &amp; Regulatory Risk Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
