        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs Mgr/Finance build the external-affairs budget: memberships/dues (W3361), sponsorships (W3367), events (W3365), community/CSR (W3371), partnerships (W3372), advocacy, and travel; align to corporate budget (links to VS-33.1)
