    <bpmn:process id="W_W3376" name="W3376. External-Affairs Annual Plan, KPI &amp; Board Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual planning; board reporting (links to VS-36.1)
Frequency: Annual + quarterly
Volume: External-affairs program
Owner: Government Affairs Manager
Participants: Govt Affairs Mgr, VP Legal &amp; Compliance, Leadership, BI (links to VS-28.1), Board (links to VS-36.1)
Source: workflow W3376 — External-Affairs Annual Plan, KPI &amp; Board Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
